msgid "All functions specified in the header have to be implemented in the script. For instance, the script file from the example above needs to implement the two functions <command>sort</command> and <command>moveLinesDown</command>. All functions have the following syntax:"
msgstr "Todas as funcións indicadas na cabeceira deben estar definidas no script. Por exemplo, o script do exemplo anterior debe fornecer o código das funcións <command>sort</command> e <command>format-paragraph</command>. Todas as funcións empregan a seguinte sintaxe:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: development.docbook:1283
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
