"}"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: development.docbook:1345
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "To extend the standard scripting API with own functions and prototypes simply create a new file in the KDE's local configuration folder <filename>$KDEHOME/share/apps/katepart/api</filename> and make sure it has a greater number (execution order) than the other <filename>*.js</filename> files in the global folder <filename>$KDEDIR/share/apps/katepart/api</filename>. &kappname; automatically searches in both folders for <filename>*.js</filename> files and executes them in the correct order."
msgid "To extend the standard scripting API with your own functions and prototypes simply create a new file in &kde;'s local configuration folder <filename>$<envar>XDG_DATA_HOME</envar>/katepart5/libraries</filename> and include it into your script using:"
msgstr "Para estender a API para scripts estándar con funcións e prototipos de seu, cree un novo ficheiro no cartafol <filename>$KDEHOME/share/apps/katepart/api</filename> e asegúrese de que ten un número superior (orde de execución) que o do resto de ficheiros <filename>*.js</filename> do cartafol <filename>$KDEDIR/share/apps/katepart/api</filename>. &kappname; busca ficheiros <filename>*.js</filename> de maneira automática en ambos os dous cartafoles e os executa na orde correcta."

