"void view.setCursorPosition(<parameter>Cursor <replaceable>cursor</replaceable></parameter>);"
msgstr ""
"void view.setCursorPosition(<parameter>int <replaceable>liña</replaceable></parameter>, <parameter>int <replaceable>columna</replaceable></parameter>);\n"
"void view.setCursorPosition(<parameter>Cursor <replaceable>cursor</replaceable></parameter>);"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: development.docbook:1772
#, no-c-format
